    "detailed_description": "We love cats! They are simply the best.<br>But let's be honest: These little rascals can also drive you crazy!<br><br>You are sitting relaxed on the couch and see from the corner of your eye that your cat jumps on the table, on which there is also a glass of water. They approach curiously and push the glass closer to the table's edge with their paw. No matter how often you say NO, they push it over the edge, making &quot;clink&quot;....<br><br>Mizi NO! is about putting together the shards the beloved cat left behind. Sort and rotate the shards and reassemble the whole in classic puzzle style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654860/extras/f09cd713c5b1c7e22c1ffa4dc58b8d55.poster.avif?t=1750324474\" width=742 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654860/extras/f09cd713c5b1c7e22c1ffa4dc58b8d55.webm?t=1750324474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654860/extras/f09cd713c5b1c7e22c1ffa4dc58b8d55.mp4?t=1750324474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Handcrafted Puzzles</strong><br>Handcrafted puzzles to tickle your brain and help you recover from a stressful day.<br></li><li> <strong>Simple Controls</strong><br>The game can be played by just clicking the left and right mouse buttons, which makes it very accessible for newcomers or seasoned puzzlers of any age.<br></li><li> <strong>Relaxing Music</strong><br>Mizi NO! has calming music - perfect for a relaxing puzzle session!</li></ul>",
